<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαυλότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>meanness, poorness, badness,</i> of persons and things,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				646b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.146
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς στολῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.4.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν βρωμάτων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.2.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. χώρας,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετή,</span>
			<i>poorness</i> of soil, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				745d
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιείκεια,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1175b25
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. μοναρχίας ἡ τυραννίς</span>
			ib. <i><span class="en">
				1160b10
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>states of bad health,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>want of accomplishments</i> or <i>skill,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				77
			</span></i> (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλαυρότης</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				641
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγῶνφ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.303
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐμὴ φ.</span> my <i>lack of
				judgement,</i> my <i>poor judgement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.2.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
				286d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in good
			sense, <i>plainness, simplicity of life,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀμφὶ τὸ σῶμα φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					11.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				4.1.30
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
